§ `s 52`

#ASSERT `the sanction is within section 52(2)` `a 2-year suspension and $10,000`
#ASSERT NOT `the sanction is within section 52(2)` `a $20,000 penalty`

#ASSERT `the maximum disciplinary penalty` `public accountant` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum disciplinary penalty` `medical practitioner` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum disciplinary penalty` `advocate and solicitor` EQUALS 100000

#ASSERT `the maximum suspension in years` `public accountant` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the maximum suspension in years` `medical practitioner` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the maximum suspension in years` `advocate and solicitor` EQUALS 5

